<group prefix="WebGpuSharp.FFI.">
	<comment location="ComputePassEncoderHandle">
		<summary> The compute pass encoder encodes commands related to controlling the compute
			shader stage, as issued by a ComputePipeline. </summary>
	</comment>
	<group prefix="ComputePassEncoderHandle.">
		<comment location="InsertDebugMarker">
			<summary>Marks a point in a stream of commands with a label.</summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="PopDebugGroup">
			<summary>Ends the labeled debug group most recently started by <see cref="PushDebugGroup"/>.</summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="PushDebugGroup">
			<summary>Begins a labeled debug group containing subsequent commands.</summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="SetBindGroup">
		</comment>
		<comment location="SetLabel">
		</comment>
	</group>
</group>